msgid "Accurate:\r\nThe crosshair will be exactly where the bullet will hit with every shot no matter the recoil.\r\n\r\nStatic:\r\nA static and unchanging crosshair in the middle of the screen.\r\n\r\nDynamic:\r\nnf\r\n\r\nNone:\r\nBecause why would I want to know where I’m aiming?"
