msgctxt "ST_Settings,Setting_Server_AllowPlayersToChangeTeams_Tooltip"
msgid "Allow players to change their team by opening the Team Selection menu."
msgstr "Erlaubt es Spielern, ihr Team via das Teamauswahlsmenü zu wechseln."

#. Key:	Setting_Server_AllowPlayersToJoinUnbalancedTeams
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Settings.ST_Settings
msgctxt "ST_Settings,Setting_Server_AllowPlayersToJoinUnbalancedTeams"
